<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-7175] Throttling is not applied to page allocation</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7175</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Found during &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6341&quot; title=&quot;Use direct IO or libaio for file page store where applicable&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-6341&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-6341&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; testing, throttling check is not done for newly allocated pages.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Allocated page already has dirty flag, but Throttling parkNanos is applied only for intially not dirty page.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For initial load case it is required to do Throttling check for mostly new pages&lt;/p&gt;</description>
